## 1. SERP Intent Analysis

### 1a. Dominant Content Format

The SERP is dominated by **comparison articles** (approximately 85% of top results). Every competitor uses an H2-anchored structure comparing the two apartment types across discrete dimensions: layout, cost, privacy, lifestyle fit. Several use comparison tables. A small number (Resource Furniture, Architecture Lab) add design-angle perspectives, but the core format is always comparison.

The article MUST be a comparison piece. Do not brief a listicle, a how-to guide, or a definitional piece. The searcher wants a side-by-side evaluation that ends with a decision recommendation.

