Top competitors range from approximately 600 words (Paris Attitude, basic) to 4,000+ words (SelfStorage.com, over-stuffed). The median useful depth is **900-1,300 words**. The highest-ranking tight articles (Bungalow, Southern Management, TreeFarm Lofts) land at approximately 700-900 words. The AI-cited Architecture Lab article is approximately 900 words.

